The '''shielded statue''' is found in Path of Het in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. The statue must receive the energy beam shot by the [[caster statue]] by redirecting it with [[Mirror (Tombs of Amascut)|mirrors]]. Doing so will weaken [[Het's Seal]] and allow players to destroy it.

